I'll break down these ideas into the appropriate categories...


The Alice in Wonderland mini-quest...

The hacker finds a glowing pink potion labeled "Drink Me", he drinks it
and is shrunk to the square, the square he's in is enlarged to 20 x 20
normal size. There, he fights the insects on the ground.

You could also see neat effects.

"You see engraved in the dust here a giant letter E."

Monsters - a, for ants and w for centipedes.

The hacker would need to find a pink lembas wafer labeled "Eat Me"
to restore himself to normal size.

-----

A new altar and God.

This may be debateable but the hacker would find a _ or a \ that
is made of gleaming white porcelain.

It is, as you may have guessed, an altar to the Roman God Feces, the
God of excrement.

When you #sit on the altar, you hear a flushing sound.
If you vomit on the altar, you hear the voice of Feces thank you
for your gift.

But, if you begin praying to Feces, you piss off your deity to the
point that he sends down a ton of brown mire onto you, you suffocate
and die.

Naturally, you can't #offer any corpses to Feces or even convert the
altar.

And this brings up a valid point. If you vomit on a normal altar,
that should enrage your deity...

"The Voice of Loki booms: HOW DARE YOU DEFILE MY ALTAR?"

