New weapons....

Cursed long sword named Woundhealer. Gives intrinsic regeneration to the
wielder, and heals monsters that it hits.

"You hit the jackal with Woundhealer. The jackal seems in better shape."
"The kobold hits you with Woundhealer. You seem in better shape."

Blessed fireproof club named Louisville Slugger. A strength dependant
two-handed weapon.

Cursed very rusty -6 long sword named Seersucker. Why Seersucker? Cause
you were the sucker who bought it at Sears. Anyone familiar with Cerebus
comics and Elric the Albino should know the reference. The weapon should
have a 25% chance of shattering when used in combat, leaving you with
a cursed long sword hilt (being wielded)

